From 7542922112f99a0af8a3fb636a2d1bb5476c61e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yichao Zhu <Yichao.Zhu@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:23:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support native BF16 paged states in ROCm KDA prefill

Read and write BF16 persistent states in the HIP chunk kernel while retaining FP32 accumulation and scan workspaces. Avoid gathering and scattering paged state, preserving inactive cache rows. Extend the existing tests for BF16 paging and checkpoint resume under graph replay.

Signed-off-by: Yichao Zhu <Yichao.Zhu@amd.com>
(cherry picked from commit 85c7ecc6eae032f6af5ab44485ca42fb76ca31a3)
